s) to avoid wasting high-value cards like 2s or Qs.\n\nReason: Using the triple_with_pair with 10s and 6s efficiently beats the last play while conserving stronger cards (2s, Qs) for future plays. The bomb is unnecessary here and should be reserved for critical moments.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠6", "♦6", "♠10", "♥10", "♦10"]}'}
